#-------------
PHAT BEET
#-------------
Biomes 		 - Spawns in temperate, non-extreme biomes.
Example    - Can spawn in Taiga biomes, but not in Snowy Taiga biomes. Hope this isn't too much for you.
Spawn Conditions - Only spawns on Coarse Dirt (biologically accurate)
Tag		 - Offense
#-------------
SUN	 	 - 7
HP 		 - 20
#-------------
Additional Notes - Attack length is 1.5 seconds (attacks on 1).
Attacks in an AOE, like uh.....................................
Like something. You can figure it out, you're smart.
Basically, does 4-8 AOE damage every time it attacks. This is to
reflect how it can "crit" in PVZ 2.
#-------------
